# Deploy to production

After finishing user-requested product work, ship it without waiting to be asked.

1. Commit the relevant files (never `.env`, credentials, or secrets).
2. Push `master` to `origin`.
3. Deploy **Vercel production**: `npx vercel --prod --yes`
4. Update the **DigitalOcean droplet** (`root@188.166.214.47`, key `~/.ssh/haixiang-bio_ed25519`):
   - `git fetch && git reset --hard origin/master` in `/var/www/cocktale`
   - `npm ci && npm run build`
   - `pm2 restart cocktale`
5. Confirm both URLs respond:
   - https://cocktale.vercel.app
   - http://cocktale.188.166.214.47.nip.io

Skip only if the user explicitly says not to deploy, or if there is nothing to ship.
